Z||000003||WKDFIRO||05-01-2000||02:49 PM||||Fieros of San Diego president, Joe Goodmon (newyork1@pacbell.net)and there is a So Cal chapter, Fieros West, President Anthony Sisneros (me!) (wkdfiro85@yahoo.com). That sounds like fun. When would this be happening? We would probably need some time to get the word out.||||reg||6
